    "Created fields on Invoices/Leads are Airtable 'Created time' (auto). TaxInvoices/Receipts use 'Last modified time' instead, so WF8's Airtable Trigger also fires on status updates (added manually — the Airtable API cannot create these field types).",
    "VATRate is stored as a decimal fraction (e.g. 0.18 for 18%), not a whole number.",
